# Allow-list: ignore everything, then re-include only the build inputs.
# `docker build` ships the working tree, not git, so gitignored local files
# (notes, .env, agent config) must never be able to enter the build context.
*

!pyproject.toml
!poetry.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
# Only Python sources of the package: stray caches, editor droppings or data
# files under src/ never reach the wheel.
!src/sensiflow/**/*.py
